</td><td _ngcontent-pxv-c3="" rowspan="1" colspan="1" class=""><span _ngcontent-pxv-c3="" style="color: #055274;" class="is-negative">(۳۷,۳۱۵,۰۸۳) </span></td><td _ngcontent-pxv-c3="" rowspan="1" colspan="1" class=""><span _ngcontent-pxv-c3="" style="color: #055274;" class="is-negative">(۴۲,۶۵۶,۲۱۰) </span></td><td _ngcontent-pxv-c3="" rowspan="1" colspan="1" class=""><span _ngcontent-pxv-c3="" style="color: #055274;">۱۳ </span></td></tr><tr _ngcontent-pxv-c3=""><!----><td _ngcontent-pxv-c3="" rowspan="1" colspan="1" class="right-aligne"><span _ngcontent-pxv-c3="" style="color: #055274;">هزينه کاهش ارزش دريافتني‏ها (هزينه استثنايي) </span></td><td _ngcontent-pxv-c3="" rowspan="1" colspan="1" class=""><span _ngcontent-pxv-c3="" style="color: #055274;">۰ </span></td><td _ngcontent-pxv-c3="" rowspan="1" colspan="1" class=""><span _ngcontent-pxv-c3="" style="color: #055274;">۰ </span></td><td _ngcontent-pxv-c3="" rowspan="1" colspan="1" class=""><span _ngcontent-pxv-c3="" style="color: #055274;"> </span></td></tr><tr _ngcontent-pxv-c3=""><!----><td _ngcontent-pxv-c3="" rowspan="1" colspan="1" class="right-aligne"><span _ngcontent-pxv-c3="" style="color: #055274;">ساير درآمدها </span></td><td _ngcontent-pxv-c3="" rowspan="1" colspan="1" class=""><span _ngcontent-pxv-c3="" style="color: #055274;">۴۱,۷۳۴,۹۹۵ </span></td><td _ngcontent-pxv-c3="" rowspan="1" colspan="1" class=""><span _ngcontent-pxv-c3="" style="color: #055274;">۴۸,۴۵۲,۲۲۱ </span></td><td _ngcontent-pxv-c3="" rowspan="1" colspan="1" class=""><span _ngcontent-pxv-c3="" style="color: #055274;" class="is-negative">(۱۴) </span></td></tr><tr _ngcontent-pxv-c3=""><!----><td _ngcontent-pxv-c3="" rowspan="1" colspan="1" class="right-aligne"><span _ngcontent-pxv-c3="" style="color: #055274;">ساير هزينه‌ها </span></td><td _ngcontent-pxv-c3="" rowspan="1" colspan="1" class=""><span _ngcontent-pxv-c3="" style="color: #055274;" class="is-negative">(۲,۰۱۹,۱۳۲) </span></td><td _ngcontent-pxv-c3="" rowspan="1" colspan="1" c